### ========================================================
### Supabase / PostgreSQL - Users API (v2)
### Base: http://localhost:4001/api/v2/users
### ========================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4001/api/v2/users

###   all users 
GET {{baseUrl}}/pg
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------------------

### 2. Create a new user 
POST {{baseUrl}}/pg
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Charlie1122",
  "email": "charlie112@example.com",
  "password": "password12311",
  "role": "user"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------

###  Update a user (Supabase)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pg/9850b366-9f28-4423-827a-db632d93837d
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Charlie111222",
  "email": "charlie1122@example.com",
  "password": "password1231122",
  "role": "user"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------

### 4. Delete a user (Supabase)
### เปลี่ยนค่า UUID ด้านล่างสุดให้ตรงกับ id ที่ต้องการลบ
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/pg/9850b366-9f28-4423-827a-db632d93837d
Accept: application/json






###  LOGIN PG 
POST http://localhost:4001/api/v2/users/pg/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "charlie112@example.com",
    "password": "password12311"
}


### 🔓 LOGOUT (ทดสอบออกจากระบบฝั่ง Postgres)
POST http://localhost:4001/api/v2/users/pg/logout